{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/03f1f5jgi6j5kdxlhex64tddb338umn.mp3","text":"嗯，博士。您今天的运势是......","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/319iub9xxj7oj8b3dnz3raf4xrw7rd8.mp3","text":"您也想知道，自己未来的命运吗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_003.mp3","text":"随时都别忘记......未知的力量引起的反作用，很可能反噬我们自身。"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/t1dcy4wfj9tcu2akfszha4adom8ep3w.mp3","text":"塔罗只能祛除内心的雾霭，却从来不曾拥有万事皆能的神性。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/35j77tfv0i7o4od1qu6eaekhndgcezb.mp3","text":"命运就像大地，谁也不能挣脱它的枷锁。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/3qszlbkme0dywkxice2tt5bzekrv2a6.mp3","text":"人无法挣脱大地的桎梏，却能改变大地的样貌。人类的行为中潜藏着无数的可能性。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/sst3wlnz7efmpltn7xqa52uoyyxqfoc.mp3","text":"运势中，存有无数主题，而最常见的就是......牌运。若要改变牌运，就要勇于改变命运。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/1awn8t7el5qafg7e0973etn4llsdk01.mp3","text":"最近在占卜师之间有一个流行的仪式，我们称之为“命运之手”，您想试试看吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/8oi9vnd3jlmzl1u964pemn94k30990j.mp3","text":"对“死亡”的占卜，在我们业内也算是种禁忌。但我认为，“死亡”并非终点，而是一个新的开始。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_010.mp3","text":"偶尔，梦境会为你展示有趣的启示，如果体验了这样的梦，要好好保存在记忆中哦，博士。"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/i7qloxikrmzm5nu83v3pj2scjju68om.mp3","text":"遵从阿尔克纳的指引，我的命运终于与您交汇了，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/rj5wvi8slazrkjchsdbffcd9k6bd6d1.mp3","text":"有灵感了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/tw7y1jiq3y94q6ueid4j0sz5037eeq7.mp3","text":"我已经在水晶里预见了这次晋升哦？呵呵，只是个玩笑而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/oomam5g9xmqm9ugh5xei73824njz8q4.mp3","text":"博士，你想知晓......自己的命运终将去往何方？很遗憾，我帮不了你。为你揭示那些秘密，并不是我的使命。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/hdr0o9anpdvaddv8muivznv1ivxskl3.mp3","text":"请稍候，先来占卜一下这次战斗的结果吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/rrf18xbjny2diisq5e0cnrxvmupkgex.mp3","text":"那么，就让我来为大家祈祷吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/n513ekoy0nolmlope7p8dh7af4pthny.mp3","text":"命运变幻无常，唯有胜者永存于世。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/6ofijz3lsogtj5zkz5mazc09d0mqvwd.mp3","text":"我看到了结果。胜利属于罗德岛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/bnza3cril34qiodhdrznbcuk5hfqfmg.mp3","text":"明智的选择。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_022.mp3","text":"我的回合。"}],"部署":[{"url":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_023.mp3","text":"抽一张卡片。"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/54lv4lhyth8827jnnlmdobs66wnf63d.mp3","text":"不要违抗你的命运。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/gpbkej6zxnhqzfphjlhxjdlsot5rpax.mp3","text":"虚空之塔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/88/jpv9xi89sghybj5i13eswglwnb5i1p2.mp3","text":"行空之战车。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/onqm33ueh4kozsjuv2mos8f11wq51fj.mp3","text":"折断帝王的权杖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/02vlar0l154dp07i2y5pyzrfwn30oth.mp3","text":"女祭司毁灭一切。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/nkbjygxt6kjltcfz44ct8oe2dk2hlce.mp3","text":"是命运扼住我们的咽喉，亦或是，我们将要对命运作绝地反击？","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/mlimshvbetkabu72dvtubgtvywrh0nb.mp3","text":"我已经将他们全部移动到墓地之中了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/igixl9ml3kltfxzjmka7f39tkx7ofps.mp3","text":"该重新洗牌了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/9j7pixmtx8afantn2yzrmk52xpvxxqw.mp3","text":"不，这不该是我们应有的命运......","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/svjpbi4pj8y5dae15sqszzv0lhjq1mn.mp3","text":"这个房间里面似乎潜藏着厄运，需要我用我的力量帮你做点什么吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/cj3aqer23vpncqjeme729j0hdq188aj.mp3","text":"嗯？怎么了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/nd1z955xoxgrjnftbp0ib1jmuhoob58.mp3","text":"想让我为您占卜下今后的运气？是嘛~请稍等一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/dz9wipdx3m5lxxo1rpe3e32n1xgaiji.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/6ihmza9zr8bz9oqv30oe7ph6rxeicj0.mp3","text":"新年快乐。博士，是不是很想让我占卜一下您今年的运势呢？其实我已经偷看过啦。我的占卜固然可靠，不过命运当然是由自己亲手揭晓才有意义。别担心，我会陪着你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/mnmpwoxfotcngabtl0fcdsf3jnmqcx4.mp3","text":"幸运之风吹拂着你，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_109_fmout/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/dfib8pfn6qwf705xdpduj1seu70sg01.mp3","text":"嗯，博士。您今天的运势是......","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/2hr9qs5r70qie1ik48duz1ax90zmvor.mp3","text":"您也想知道，自己未来的命运吗......","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/r78bqbk1kmum74zpufifockymkucuu9.mp3","text":"随时都别忘记......未知的力量引起的反作用，很可能反噬我们自身。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/9m0se7f17qd4g90u3j8j0gwg2t224sh.mp3","text":"塔罗只能祛除内心的雾霭，却从来不曾拥有万事皆能的神性。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/l7zgpw78jc0g7v04v32lw9v20edcdr2.mp3","text":"命运就像大地，谁也不能挣脱它的枷锁。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/1gn922e0sdkeixie569dnrsz3mgpuc2.mp3","text":"人无法挣脱大地的桎梏，却能改变大地的样貌。人类的行为中潜藏着无数的可能性。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/hhjc11plkzp5i6seqfecl6ex3su4gyq.mp3","text":"运势中，存有无数主题，而最常见的就是......牌运。若要改变牌运，就要勇于改变命运。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/hi4tympueyvi18e50keczpacpbx9hdr.mp3","text":"最近在占卜师之间有一个流行的仪式，我们称之为“命运之手”，您想试试看吗？","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/p5ait6wqjjan6ncb9biyu9n8ba2a2pz.mp3","text":"对“死亡”的占卜，在我们业内也算是种禁忌。但我认为，“死亡”并非终点，而是一个新的开始。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/ihrmilmx0crmd31zz2s060j0lepclfi.mp3","text":"偶尔，梦境会为你展示有趣的启示，如果体验了这样的梦，要好好保存在记忆中哦，博士。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/ab03v6cubcu5prsi8q7t2dbus25vvkj.mp3","text":"遵从阿尔克纳的指引，我的命运终于与您交汇了，博士。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/78zykcg1zwj7coj1u40usss1rf28izi.mp3","text":"有灵感了呢。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/ibdxjhc5r0iswbqf44pv4rlryoq9y22.mp3","text":"我已经在水晶里预见了这次晋升哦？呵呵，只是个玩笑而已。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/20bol2rx63xm5n6ej63dj2tf9ure59g.mp3","text":"博士，你想知晓......自己的命运终将去往何方？很遗憾，我帮不了你。为你揭示那些秘密，并不是我的使命。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/azl017algo38pd75imr171zr4t6jglo.mp3","text":"请稍候，先来占卜一下这次战斗的结果吧。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/jr3edu871ix0kexih2mvxh24x8t41qm.mp3","text":"那么，就让我来为大家祈祷吧。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/3y2akfqc6t0t5oofhyjx8cgfpolvato.mp3","text":"命运变幻无常，唯有胜者永存于世。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/owbweoorfvvcka6olkyq5tpa94kwl8n.mp3","text":"我看到了结果。胜利属于罗德岛。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/ebaq82puigt0ksh5fwmygyeju9fkoot.mp3","text":"明智的选择。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/mtv5mhdu6eb8w49be2hu55cizpai6mb.mp3","text":"我的回合。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/pp5x5hqxczkx10ag1qfqd9czepbayu3.mp3","text":"抽一张卡片。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/h9qwfoyi3klmzk8w4hf09nf9ayxiadn.mp3","text":"不要违抗你的命运。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/rfm05l52hzyjeek85xx3w5mowk81hlx.mp3","text":"虚空之塔。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/7vuq1ndj4ysw5rne01kaqgzlh49zn8t.mp3","text":"行空之战车。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/94/s6it8fcfh5mj3wbc1hnpqycjgo104co.mp3","text":"折断帝王的权杖。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/brybceq0njh970i0my6rewxvjcn8g7w.mp3","text":"女祭司毁灭一切。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/nlgu9t15id25iysravzjsarig5687br.mp3","text":"是命运扼住我们的咽喉，亦或是，我们将要对命运作绝地反击？","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/8lu529qqw7jihudo8bchpqr0jxiblj7.mp3","text":"我已经将他们全部移动到墓地之中了。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/6vc42g64lhzhsq0jq19ep48vtvw37dd.mp3","text":"该重新洗牌了。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/9zmaq4gl19dgwac9mlfcxkf5htcemjk.mp3","text":"不，这不该是我们应有的命运......","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/30hmpeqmevsl3qxr9tcvqdsd3ostz84.mp3","text":"这个房间里面似乎潜藏着厄运，需要我用我的力量帮你做点什么吗？","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/f6by7acfcm7aei5pxy3tv96uf2frqbo.mp3","text":"嗯？怎么了？","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/7iest2og9jr6e2e086kv1l0zclogusi.mp3","text":"想让我为您占卜下今后的运气？是嘛~请稍等一下。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/qhe22awca66domih7zimye6w32332kd.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/9ozbxfh4w5v83dlvdmem5eu70rvchcu.mp3","text":"新年快乐。博士，是不是很想让我占卜一下您今年的运势呢？其实我已经偷看过啦。我的占卜固然可靠，不过命运当然是由自己亲手揭晓才有意义。别担心，我会陪着你的。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/5n5neokrnc48t9xc30fdxb5zsa33ecg.mp3","text":"幸运之风吹拂着你，博士。","alt":"voice/char_109_fmout/cn_042.mp3"}]}}